# #277: analog crouch release on both fighters. Releases ramp from full down to centre over 2-6 frames, then the stick rests with noise inside Melee's crouch band (0.625-0.6875) around 0.6875, 0.675 (the tilt modifier's down cap), 0.6625 (the down bit), 0.65, and around the 0.28 deadzone.
